  "description": "NGINX OSS：指标来自 nginx-prometheus-exporter 抓取 stub_status（默认 :9113，路径 /metrics）。与 cAdvisor 无关。多实例时用变量 instance 过滤；请在 Prometheus 中配置 scrape 与数据源 UID。",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "content": "**采集侧**：`nginx/nginx-prometheus-exporter`，NGINX 需开启 `stub_status`（例如 `location /stub_status { stub_status; allow 127.0.0.1; deny all; }`），Exporter 使用 `--nginx.scrape-uri=.../stub_status`。\n\n**常用指标**：`nginx_up`、`nginx_http_requests_total`、`nginx_connections_active`、`nginx_connections_{reading,writing,waiting}`、`nginx_connections_{accepted,handled}`（后两者为 Counter，面板用 `rate()`）。\n\n**说明**：stub_status **不含**按 URL/状态码的 QPS 分解；需要更细粒度请用 access log（Loki/ELK）或 NGINX Plus API。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "说明",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "异常" } }, "type": "value" },
            { "options": { "1": { "color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "正常" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.4.2",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "min(nginx_up{instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "stub_status 采集状态",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": 0 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 3 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.4.2",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_http_requests_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HTTP 请求速率（合计）",
      "type": "stat"
    },
